ter truncate font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] hover:underline text-slate-400">@totoro3miyazaki</span></a></div></div></section><section><div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><h2 class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-300/80">Jump to edge</h2><span class="h-px flex-1 bg-slate-800"></span><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-400">5<!-- --> views</span></div><div class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><a href="/en/whale-alerts" class="group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/55 hover:border-cyan-400/30 hover:bg-slate-950/80 p-4 no-underline transition-all"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-base bg-emerald-500/10">🐋</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-cyan-200">Whale Alerts</h3><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-cyan-300">→</span></div><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">The biggest bets on the tape, the second they print.</p></div></div></a><a href="/en/fresh-trades" class="group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/55 hover:border-cyan-400/30 hover:bg-slate-950/80 p-4 no-underline transition-all"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-base bg-blue-500/10">⚡</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-cyan-200">Fresh Trades</h3><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-cyan-300">→</span></div><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">New wallets hitting the board with first-time conviction.</p></div></div></a><a href="/en/traders" class="group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/55 hover:border-cyan-400/30 hover:bg-slate-950/80 p-4 no-underline transition-all"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-base bg-violet-500/10">🏆</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-cyan-200">Profitable Traders</h3><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-cyan-300">→</span></div><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Wallets stacking the most P&amp;L right now.</p></div></div></a><a href="/en/news" class="group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/55 hover:border-cyan-400/30 hover:bg-slate-950/80 p-4 no-underline transition-all"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-base bg-orange-500/10">📰</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-cyan-200">News</h3><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-cyan-300">→</span></div><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Headlines matched live to prediction markets.</p></div></div></a><a href="/en/world-preview" class="group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/55 hover:border-cyan-400/30 hover:bg-slate-950/80 p-4 no-underline transition-all"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-base bg-cyan-500/10">🌍</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-cyan-200">World Intelligence</h3><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-cyan-300">→</span></div><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Geo-tagged markets on a live 3D globe.</p></div></div></a></div></section><section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-10" aria-label="What is PolyInsider?"><div class="max-w-3xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl text-white">What is PolyInsider?</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4"><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">PolyInsider is a real-time analytics dashboard for Polymarket, the largest prediction market. It watches the live trade feed and shows you what moved, how strong the conviction looks, and where to act next, without you sitting there reading the chain yourself.</p><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">The core is whale tracking. Every large bet on Polymarket is surfaced the moment it prints, with the trader’s true position size pulled from on-chain data so the number is accurate rather than a partial fill. Alongside whale alerts, PolyInsider flags fresh wallets placing their first bet on a market, matches breaking news to the markets it moves, and maps geo-tagged markets on a live 3D globe.</p><p class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Every market and every trader has its own page with live prices, order flow, and profit and loss history. PolyInsider is free, independent, and built for traders who want an edge on Polymarket prediction markets.</p></div><p class="mt-10 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-300/80">Frequently asked questions</p><div class="mt-4 space-y-5"><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">What is PolyInsider?</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">PolyInsider is a real-time analytics dashboard for Polymarket prediction markets. It tracks whale trades, fresh wallet activity, news matched to live markets, and visualizes geo-tagged markets on a 3D globe.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">How are whale alerts detected?</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Whale alerts surface buy trades above $5,000 from any wallet on Polymarket, streamed in real time via the Polymarket WebSocket feed and reconciled against on-chain positions for accurate sizing.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">What are fresh trades?</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Fresh trades are entries from wallets making their first significant bet on a market, surfacing early conviction before whales pile in.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">Is PolyInsider free?</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Yes, PolyInsider is free to use. We do not collect personal data, and outbound Polymarket links may include a referral parameter.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">Is PolyInsider affiliated with Polymarket?</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">No, PolyInsider is an independent analytics platform and is not affiliated with Polymarket.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">Which markets does PolyInsider cover?</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">PolyInsider covers all active Polymarket markets, including politics, sports, crypto, economics, and culture, with a dedicated page for every market and every trader.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-white">How is PolyInsider different from the Polymarket app?</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Polymarket lets you trade; PolyInsider reads the order flow for you. It surfaces whale bets, fresh-wallet entries, and news catalysts in real time so you can spot moves before they are obvious, then trade them on Polymarket.</p></div></div></div></section></div><!--$?--><template id="B:1"></template><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="mt-16 border-t border-slate-800/80"><div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-8 flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">PolyInsider</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">Real-time Polymarket intelligence designed to surface the trades worth acting on.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><button class="rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-all border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700">Terms &amp; Privacy</button><a href="https://polymarket.com/?via=polyinsider" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-all border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700"><img alt="Polymarket" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-4 w-4" style="color:transparent" src="/branding/polymarket-icon-white.svg"/>Open Polymarket</a><a href="https://x.com/PolyInsider_" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-all border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.9 3H21l-4.58 5.24L21.8 21h-4.22l-3.31-4.97L9.92 21H7.8l4.9-5.6L7.55 3h4.33l2.99 4.57L18.9 3Z"></path></svg>Follow @PolyInsider_</a></div></div></footer></div></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src="/_next/static/chu